OL,3,AUS transport secretary to give update
OL,4,Aas flight disruption continues after
OL,5,Aground stop
OL,6,
OL,7,FFlights across the US have been delayed
OL,8,For cancelled on Saturday morning, as
OL,9,Fknock-on disruption continues after a
OL,10,Fnationwide ground stop
OL,12,FThe grounding began at around 16:00 EST
OL,13,F(21:00 GMT) on Friday and lasted more
OL,14,Fthan four hours - here's a timeline of
OL,15,Fhow it unfolded
OL,17,FDuffy previously said the ripple
OL,18,Feffects could last for days - it was
OL,19,Fthe longest ground stop in the US since
OL,20,Fthe one after the 9/11 attacks in 2001
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
